# The four noise effects that request a square 2 cry, one after another, each
# with its own rDIV: Metroid Queen cry ($09 -> square 2 $03) at tick 0, Queen
# hurt cry ($0A -> $06) at tick 70, baby Metroid clearing blocks ($16 -> $04)
# at tick 140, baby Metroid cry ($17 -> $05) at tick 160, which cuts the
# clearing block off on both channels. Over song $04. Five seconds.
